{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41b6fd3c11a762590dd49a10eb1aa60b0472430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2x}216 = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is real, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1ad0aa4badf91f0d416445b90ad40889011040c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{A non-square, non-cube integer}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"263\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12eb7457868e2ae04580b9027ac23af1cdef2b86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{A non-square, non-cube, non-integral rational number}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efac413047e86763c26d46c1d272ed80f8ee41a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{An irrational number}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6469f9cc7f0cf613809b4692226d475ea7465e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{A perfect square}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea4e301f7c6397e7b5637e56b4e0e77c3ba0abe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{A perfect cube}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite the equation to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe88915048c290f602798aff82d506e94d0d492b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^x = 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is the base of the logarithm, we only need to check x-values that are positive.\n</p><p>With trial and error, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a solution because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25fec0bace31904683ae62aa506fe6f3af2546fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\cdot 3)^3 = 6^3 = 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"19\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/4/6d4aa69086b2d2b64a04c0e7335dc295da826593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> gets larger as x gets larger, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the only solution, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use the definition of logarithms: if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717e106f14c1a8ebc1f49dd1ce91adc9489e679c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e5001cdda41f9d3d5ca897b35c36a64271a0d1b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Applying this to the given equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60d8c4543f5fb2cdc682ec6888504b2aa10b9160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2x} 216 = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />, we obtain\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe88915048c290f602798aff82d506e94d0d492b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^x = 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73fc3e1b03ec11ac4a6ecf5313d1a6f433da109.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$216$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb727737c86860eb4f99b6878465cadb06cfc6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />. By checking small positive integer values, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> satisfies the equation since\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25fec0bace31904683ae62aa506fe6f3af2546fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\cdot 3)^3 = 6^3 = 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, which is a non-square, non-cube integer. Hence, the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bfc73fea02e84d95c33ab71708c9398cd77b070.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(Solution by Trashboycan)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problem