0_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017122206\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2649/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4857/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.871      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n100.00%    8.871      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16258:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017122206 and revision id 280565. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}